			ElegirCarpeta: "{0} applicable buffs. Pick a folder or search."
			MostrandoParcial: Showing {0} of {1} {2}.
			MostrandoTodos: "{0} buffs {1}."
		}
	}

	Apariencia: {
		Vista: Preview
		VerConArmadura: With armour
		VerConArmaduraAyuda: Shows the armour and accessories you have equipped right now, or just the base outfit.
