	MostrandoTodos: "{0} items {1}."
	AyudaDestino: Click = 1 unit to the mouse; right-click = a full stack. Drop it down here.

	Aviso: {
		Sumado: +{0} "{1}" on the mouse (x{2}).
		AlMaximo: '''"{0}" is already at its max on the mouse.'''
		NoCabe: What you were carrying does not fit: drop it first.
